{"r":"swH","lane":{"p":1460,"e":[{"h":"سَاحٌ","t":["[originally ",[2,"سَوَحٌ"],"]: see what follows."]},{"h":"سَاحَةٌ","t":["[originally ",[2,"سَوَحَةٌ"],"] The ",[1,"court,"]," or ",[1,"open area,"]," of a house; i. e. ",[1,"a spacious vacant part"]," or ",[1,"portion"]," thereof, ",[1,"in which is no building;"]," (Msb voce ",[2,"عَرْصَةٌ"],";) ",[1,"a part"]," of a house ",[1,"in which is no building nor roof:"]," (Har p. 33:) its ",[2,"بَاحَة"],": (S:) or its ",[1,"yard;"]," i. e. ",[1,"a spacious place in front"]," of a house: (Msb in the present art.:) or ",[1,"a wide,"]," or ",[1,"spacious, place, among the dwellings of a tribe:"]," and ",[1,"a side, region, quarter,"]," or ",[1,"tract;"]," or ",[1,"a lateral,"]," or ",[1,"an outward"]," or ",[1,"adjacent, part"]," or ",[1,"portion;"]," syn. ",[2,"نَاحِيَةٌ"],": (K:) the pl. is ↓ ",[2,"سَاحٌ"]," [or rather this is a coll. gen. n. of which ",[2,"ساحة"]," is the n. un.] and [the pl. is] ",[2,"سَاحَاتٌ"]," (S, Msb, K) and ",[2,"سُوحٌ"],"; (S, K;) the last like ",[2,"بُدْنٌ"]," pl. of ",[2,"بَدَنَةٌ"],", and ",[2,"خُشْبٌ"]," pl. of ",[2,"خَشَبَةٌ"],": (S:) the dim. is ↓ ",[2,"سُوَيْحَةٌ"],". (TA.) [See also 7 in art. ",[2,"سيح"],".] One says, ",[2,"عَمَرَ ٱللّٰهُ سَاحَتَكَ"]," [",[1,"May God people thy court,"]," or ",[1,"yard;"]," or ",[1,"make it to be well stocked with people and the like"],"]. (A.) And in a case of drought you say, ",[2,"اِحْمَرَّ"],[2,"ٱللُّوحُ وَٱغُبَرَّ ٱلسُّوحُ"]," [",[1,"The air,"]," or ",[1,"atmosphere, has become red, and the courts,"]," or ",[1,"yards, have become very dusty"],"]. (A.) You say also, ",[2,"إِنَّهُ لَبَرِىْءُ السَّاحَةِ"],", a phrase like ",[2,"إِنَّهُ لَبَرِىْءُ العَذِرَةِ"]," [expl. in art. ",[2,"عذر"],"]. (TA in art. ",[2,"عذر"],".)"]},{"h":"سُوَيْحَةٌ","t":["dim. of ",[2,"سَاحَةٌ"],", q. v. (TA.)"]}]},"maqayis":["السين والواو والحاء كلمة واحدة. يقال ساحة الدار، وجمعها ساحات وسوح."]}